The exact timings are machine-load sensitive; `selftest_report.json` is authoritative for this run.

## Oracle loop and G9 diagnostics

No valid oracle attempt occurred. The harness made four retries in each arm, and every request failed with the same account-level HTTP 403. Errors do not consume attempts and cannot be counted as model failures.

